; Root hints for the lab.
;
; A recursive resolver has to start somewhere. This file is the only thing
; it knows before it has asked any questions: "the root servers live here".
; The real-world version lists a.root-servers.net through m.root-servers.net
; (https://www.internic.net/domain/named.root). Ours lists one lab server.
.                     3600000  NS  a.root-servers.net.
a.root-servers.net.   3600000  A   10.53.0.2
